  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "MediaInfo.Wrapper 26.10.0\n\nMediaInfoLib 26.10, through MediaInfo.Native 26.10.0. Targets net4.0, net4.5, net481 (new). The asynchronous analyzer is in MediaInfo.Wrapper.Core only. Previous release: 26.1.0.\n\nADDED\n\n- AudioStream.DynamicObjects, SubtitleStream.MaxCharactersPerLine.\n- VideoStream.Rotation, ScanType, DisplayAspectRatio.\n- More audio, subtitle, video and HDR format identifiers.\n- P/Invoke declarations for the remaining MediaInfoLib exports.\n\nCHANGED\n\n- DTS:X reports 12 channels (7.1.4) instead of 8; its objects are in DynamicObjects.\n- Five-channel Opus is 5.0, not 4.1.\n- MP3 duration and bit rate are more accurate with encoder delay or a Xing header.\n- MediaInfoList.Open honours InfoFileOptions.\n\nFIXED\n\n- Heap corruption (process exit 0xc0000374): strings owned by the native library were freed by the runtime.\n- MediaInfoWrapper no longer passes a missing file to the native library.\n\nRelease notes: https://github.com/yartat/MP-MediaInfo/blob/master/docs/release-notes/26.10.0.md",
